"Odeslat pouze oznámení o pohledávce po splatnosti (v rámci povoleného "
"zpoždění platby)."

#: plugins/BookkeepingPohoda/src/Command/ProcessDebtorsCommand.php:45
msgid ""
"Send only a notification of blocking (or continuing debt for services no "
"longer active) for overdue claims (after an allowed delay in payment)."
